WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.334
Joining us now, one of the

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:01.835
two state

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:03.803
representatives who was expelled

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:05.805
last night, and that is Justin Jones.

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:07.240
Justin, good morning to you.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.175
I really appreciate you joining us.

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:11.544
I know you haven't had any sleep

00:00:11.544 --> 00:00:13.079
and I have to commend you right off

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:13.446
in the way

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:14.714
that you have conducted yourself,

00:00:14.714 --> 00:00:15.682
you and your colleagues.

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:17.117
It has been notable.

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:19.052
And so thank you for joining us.

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:20.887
This has captured the attention

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:21.955
of the country.

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:23.189
Your message to the nation,

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:24.858
this is almost after

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:25.959
having been expelled.

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:27.394
How are you feeling

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:29.863
Sir, thank you so much

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:30.797
for having me this morning.

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:32.599
So I'll pray with very little sleep.

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:35.268
No need to apologize at all.

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:37.937
What what happened yesterday was

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:40.306
was a very sad day for democracy,

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:41.274
not just in Tennessee, but

00:00:41.274 --> 00:00:42.575
in this nation. And so

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:44.644
I think that there's a lot of

00:00:44.644 --> 00:00:46.513
thoughts going through my head.

00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:48.748
The House Republicans chairman,

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:49.649
who you just saw in

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:51.418
this video, is still doubling down,

00:00:51.418 --> 00:00:52.352
even though he is

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:53.887
the same Republican chairman

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:56.289
who engaged in inappropriate behavior

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:57.357
and is still in leadership,

00:00:57.357 --> 00:00:59.359
as you can see, and was not expelled.

00:00:59.359 --> 00:00:59.692
But, you know,

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:00.560
we have been expelled

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:01.861
for standing with our constituents.

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:03.029
But I have no regrets.

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:04.064
I will continue to speak up

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:06.366
for District 52 and for Tennesseans

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:07.600
who are demanding change

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:08.501
Let's let's talk

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:09.636
a little bit more about your colleague.

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:10.970
You're talking about Jeremy Faison.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.806
He's a Republican caucus chair

00:01:12.806 --> 00:01:14.007
in the state House.

00:01:14.007 --> 00:01:17.010
Last night, he did an interview

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:19.279
with my colleague, Kaitlan Collins,

00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:20.847
and he said he's wondering

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:21.815
why you have an apologize.

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:22.282
Let's listen

00:01:22.282 --> 00:01:23.283
and then we'll get your response.

00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:25.985
I'd like to add

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:26.786
to your

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:28.054
say they've not backed down

00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:29.556
from that either.

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:32.125
I told them earlier that I feel like

00:01:32.358 --> 00:01:34.627
if they would have said, you know what,

00:01:34.961 --> 00:01:36.162
we messed up.

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:38.231
I mean, what American wouldn't

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:41.901
human bring forgiveness and redemption?

00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:44.270
But they doubled down and went so far

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:45.271
as to stand in the world today

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:48.241
and said, I would do it again.

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.742
You haven't apologized.

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:52.745
What what is your response to that?

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:55.081
I mean, I think Representative Faison

00:01:55.081 --> 00:01:56.749
needs to reflect on his own actions

00:01:56.749 --> 00:01:58.251
as a representative

00:01:58.251 --> 00:02:00.320
just earlier this year.

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:01.621
Last year,

00:02:01.621 --> 00:02:02.222
I was in a phase

00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:03.723
and pulled down the pants of a referee

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:05.458
because he got mad at a basketball game.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:06.993
And he's still the Republican leadership,

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:09.129
not expelled, not sanctioned in any way.

00:02:09.329 --> 00:02:11.331
And so for him to tell us to apologize

00:02:11.998 --> 00:02:13.533
for standing up for our constituents,

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:14.434
I told the speaker,

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:16.002
I told that body yesterday

00:02:16.002 --> 00:02:17.203
that I would apologize

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:19.472
when they apologized to the families

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:20.106
in covenant

00:02:20.106 --> 00:02:21.174
and in the mass shootings

00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:22.342
across this nation

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:22.742
politically,

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:25.278
but particularly in our state at Covenant

00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:27.313
and in the wall of house

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:29.082
mass shooting for these reckless gun laws

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:30.884
that they pass that allowed people

00:02:30.884 --> 00:02:32.118
to lose their loved ones,

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:33.119
apologize to the families

00:02:33.119 --> 00:02:34.921
of the victims of these mass shootings.

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:36.322
And we will apologize for our

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:37.357
for our actions.

00:02:37.357 --> 00:02:38.658
I think I know the answer to this,

00:02:38.658 --> 00:02:39.826
but I have to ask you anyway,

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:40.593
just for the record,

00:02:40.593 --> 00:02:41.728
so you could be reelected.

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:43.263
Do you want to serve again, just in

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:45.698
I mean, definitely.

00:02:45.698 --> 00:02:46.633
I think what happened

00:02:46.633 --> 00:02:49.035
was a travesty of democracy because it

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:50.537
they expelled the two youngest

00:02:50.537 --> 00:02:51.337
black lawmakers,

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:52.906
which is no coincidence

00:02:52.906 --> 00:02:55.074
from the Tennessee legislature.

00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:56.476
Because we are outspoken,

00:02:56.476 --> 00:02:57.677
because we fight for our district.

00:02:57.677 --> 00:02:59.712
I will want to continue to do that.

00:02:59.913 --> 00:03:01.381
And whether I'm inside the chamber,

00:03:01.381 --> 00:03:02.715
outside the chamber,

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:03.650
because what we saw in Tennessee

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.685
yesterday was was an attack on democracy

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:07.854
and a very overt racism,

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:08.655
as you can see, that

00:03:08.655 --> 00:03:09.355
the two youngest

00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:10.590
black lawmakers were kicked out

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:11.624
but are calling my dear

00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:12.825
sister Gloria Johnson, a white

00:03:12.825 --> 00:03:13.960
woman, was not

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:14.928
and we see clearly

00:03:14.928 --> 00:03:15.929
the nation is seeing clearly

00:03:15.929 --> 00:03:17.297
what is going on in Tennessee.

00:03:17.297 --> 00:03:17.497
Yeah.

00:03:17.497 --> 00:03:19.866
Listen to say there's a double standard.

00:03:19.899 --> 00:03:20.800
Some people may

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.068
sort of speculate about it,

00:03:22.068 --> 00:03:23.303
but I think it is obvious,

00:03:23.303 --> 00:03:25.672
considering that the two black members

00:03:25.672 --> 00:03:26.940
who were men.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:27.640
Right.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:28.775
Were were expelled,

00:03:28.775 --> 00:03:30.677
but the white woman was not.

00:03:30.677 --> 00:03:31.744
What do you want to say to that?

00:03:31.744 --> 00:03:32.712
Speak more, please.

00:03:34.581 --> 00:03:34.981
I want to say that

00:03:34.981 --> 00:03:36.316
this is what we've been challenging

00:03:36.316 --> 00:03:38.751
all session was a very toxic

00:03:38.952 --> 00:03:40.119
racist work environment

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:41.788
where we are not even allowed to speak.

00:03:41.788 --> 00:03:42.689
That's why we went to the well,

00:03:42.689 --> 00:03:44.290
because the speaker when it calling us,

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:45.692
he cut off our microphones.

00:03:45.692 --> 00:03:47.460
He he ruled us how to order in time.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.162
We brought up the issue of gun violence.

00:03:49.162 --> 00:03:49.862
And when I went outside

00:03:49.862 --> 00:03:51.331
to support the protesters,

00:03:51.331 --> 00:03:52.432
he turned off my voting machine

00:03:52.432 --> 00:03:53.566
so I couldn't even cast a vote

00:03:53.566 --> 00:03:54.500
on the House floor.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:55.835
I mean, this is what we've dealt

00:03:55.835 --> 00:03:57.070
with all session.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:57.537
And yesterday,

00:03:57.537 --> 00:03:59.038
the nation was able to see that

00:03:59.038 --> 00:04:00.573
we don't have democracy in Tennessee,

00:04:00.573 --> 00:04:01.608
particularly when it comes

00:04:01.608 --> 00:04:03.009
to black and brown communities.

00:04:03.009 --> 00:04:03.876
And so

00:04:03.876 --> 00:04:04.477
what we saw

00:04:04.477 --> 00:04:06.112
yesterday was an attack on the future

00:04:06.112 --> 00:04:07.614
of a multiracial democracy.

00:04:07.614 --> 00:04:08.848
But we are in a state

00:04:08.848 --> 00:04:10.883
where the birthplace of the Klan,

00:04:10.883 --> 00:04:12.885
we were a state where we had a KKK statue

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:15.021
in our capital until very recently.

00:04:15.154 --> 00:04:17.190
And we protested to have that removed.

00:04:17.357 --> 00:04:18.424
But what they're trying to do

00:04:18.424 --> 00:04:19.659
is to bring this back today

00:04:19.659 --> 00:04:21.060
that we don't want to go to.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:21.561
If I didn't know

00:04:21.561 --> 00:04:22.262
this happened to me,

00:04:22.262 --> 00:04:24.297
I would think that this was 1963

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:25.698
instead of 2023.

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:28.801
If the Nashville City

00:04:28.801 --> 00:04:29.802
Council next week

00:04:29.802 --> 00:04:31.571
wants to appoint you as an interim

00:04:31.571 --> 00:04:33.273
representative to district,

00:04:33.273 --> 00:04:34.440
you would do it

00:04:35.908 --> 00:04:38.144
Most definitely, yes.

00:04:38.811 --> 00:04:40.380
Let's talk about the issue.

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.314
Let me ask you why.

00:04:41.314 --> 00:04:43.683
Why, considering all everything

00:04:43.683 --> 00:04:44.751
that has happened right now,

00:04:44.751 --> 00:04:46.919
why even go through all the rigmarole

00:04:49.756 --> 00:04:50.723
because it's important

00:04:50.723 --> 00:04:53.793
to let them know that democracy,

00:04:54.827 --> 00:04:55.962
we will fight for democracy,

00:04:55.962 --> 00:04:58.431
we'll fight for a multiracial democracy.

00:04:58.431 --> 00:04:59.098
And so this

00:04:59.098 --> 00:05:01.200
this extreme tactic to expel us

00:05:01.401 --> 00:05:02.735
and to try to humiliate us

00:05:02.735 --> 00:05:04.103
has only put a spotlight

00:05:04.103 --> 00:05:05.772
of the world on Tennessee.

00:05:05.772 --> 00:05:07.307
And so I will go back

00:05:07.307 --> 00:05:09.542
because fighting for the future.

00:05:10.043 --> 00:05:11.911
I'm 27 years old, fighting for the future

00:05:11.911 --> 00:05:12.612
that I want to live

00:05:12.612 --> 00:05:13.946
in, that I want my children to live in.

00:05:14.881 --> 00:05:16.516
It's worth whatever sacrifice

00:05:16.516 --> 00:05:17.350
that we have to give,

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:18.651
whether it's being expelled,

00:05:18.651 --> 00:05:19.986
whether it is being

00:05:19.986 --> 00:05:21.054
in a hostile environment.

00:05:21.054 --> 00:05:22.989
Because I want to create a community

00:05:22.989 --> 00:05:23.890
that our young people

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:25.358
can not just survive,

00:05:25.358 --> 00:05:26.693
but they can thrive and flourish.

00:05:26.693 --> 00:05:27.860
And that's what we were asking

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:28.761
them was a very basic

00:05:28.761 --> 00:05:30.563
thing, was to ban assault weapons

00:05:30.563 --> 00:05:32.165
so we can stop these mass shootings.

00:05:32.165 --> 00:05:33.299
Instead, they responded

00:05:33.299 --> 00:05:34.667
by assaulting democracy.

00:05:34.667 --> 00:05:36.502
And that is shameful and it's very scary.

00:05:36.502 --> 00:05:37.804
Do you think you can work with them?

00:05:37.804 --> 00:05:40.873
There's so much opposition there.

00:05:41.641 --> 00:05:43.209
I mean, we are the voice of the

00:05:43.209 --> 00:05:43.976
opposition party.

00:05:43.976 --> 00:05:45.044
Our role

00:05:45.044 --> 00:05:47.814
in our party, there was only 24 members.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:50.183
There's 20 to 75 Republicans.

00:05:50.717 --> 00:05:52.352
Our role was to be a speed bump

00:05:52.352 --> 00:05:53.252
to try and stop them

00:05:53.252 --> 00:05:56.122
from driving this train off of the cliff

00:05:56.222 --> 00:05:57.957
so that we no longer have democracy.

00:05:57.957 --> 00:05:58.658
I mean, our job

00:05:58.658 --> 00:06:00.626
was to be a voice of moral dissent.

00:06:00.626 --> 00:06:01.861
Our job was to be a voice

00:06:01.861 --> 00:06:02.862
of check on power.

00:06:02.862 --> 00:06:03.563
That was what we did

00:06:03.563 --> 00:06:04.163
and that's what we did

00:06:04.163 --> 00:06:05.131
every day we were in the body,

00:06:05.131 --> 00:06:06.366
which is why they expelled us,

00:06:06.366 --> 00:06:07.266
because in every committee

00:06:07.266 --> 00:06:07.633
I was on,

00:06:07.633 --> 00:06:09.369
I stood up and spoke out

00:06:09.369 --> 00:06:10.403
on the House floor

00:06:10.403 --> 00:06:12.105
where some of the most outspoken members,

00:06:12.105 --> 00:06:13.306
and they retaliated

00:06:13.306 --> 00:06:15.208
not because of that one incidence of us

00:06:15.208 --> 00:06:16.342
going to the well and joining

00:06:16.342 --> 00:06:17.643
those young people protesting

00:06:17.643 --> 00:06:18.411
gun violence,

00:06:18.411 --> 00:06:20.246
but because they got tired

00:06:20.246 --> 00:06:21.514
and did not feel like young black men

00:06:21.514 --> 00:06:23.416
have a right to be at the same diocese.

00:06:23.416 --> 00:06:24.684
Then they felt like young black men

00:06:24.684 --> 00:06:25.385
don't have the right to sit

00:06:25.385 --> 00:06:26.219
in the chamber with them.

00:06:26.219 --> 00:06:27.687
They don't see us as equal.

00:06:27.687 --> 00:06:28.488
The House speaker, Cameron

00:06:28.488 --> 00:06:29.655
Sexton, has trafficked

00:06:29.655 --> 00:06:31.023
in the rhetoric of racism.

00:06:31.023 --> 00:06:31.657
He's traffic

00:06:31.657 --> 00:06:33.693
in the rhetoric of racialized narratives.

00:06:33.826 --> 00:06:36.095
And so we know what we're facing.

00:06:36.095 --> 00:06:36.863
But it's worth

00:06:36.863 --> 00:06:38.398
whatever sacrifice we have to make

00:06:38.398 --> 00:06:40.767
because the future we want to live in

00:06:40.767 --> 00:06:42.602
is what we're working for.

00:06:42.602 --> 00:06:44.103
One last thing.

00:06:44.103 --> 00:06:47.106
In an odd way, this has given you

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.642
a very big a much bigger platform.

00:06:50.543 --> 00:06:52.011
The White House is weighing in

00:06:52.011 --> 00:06:52.678
the current

00:06:52.678 --> 00:06:53.813
and the former White House

00:06:53.813 --> 00:06:55.081
current and former presidents

00:06:55.081 --> 00:06:56.416
both weighing in on this.

00:06:57.383 --> 00:06:59.452
How do you tend to use that

00:06:59.452 --> 00:07:00.920
newly garnered platform,

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:04.090
elevated platform that you have

00:07:05.224 --> 00:07:06.259
I mean, what

00:07:06.259 --> 00:07:07.560
what our protest was about

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:08.895
when we went to the well to stand with

00:07:08.895 --> 00:07:09.962
these young people was to

00:07:09.962 --> 00:07:11.297
elevate their voices.

00:07:11.297 --> 00:07:12.432
And so with this platform,

00:07:12.432 --> 00:07:14.634
we hope to continue to lift up the issues

00:07:14.634 --> 00:07:16.569
that that a week after mass shooting.

00:07:16.569 --> 00:07:17.403
I represent a part

00:07:17.403 --> 00:07:19.205
I represented a part of Nashville

00:07:19.205 --> 00:07:20.139
and our community

00:07:20.139 --> 00:07:21.541
still grieving communities and trauma.

00:07:21.541 --> 00:07:22.942
These young people are begging us to say

00:07:22.942 --> 00:07:24.210
we want to live in schools.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:26.179
We must continue to lift up the issues.

00:07:26.179 --> 00:07:27.280
And like I told my colleagues

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.281
who expelled me,

00:07:28.281 --> 00:07:28.614
no matter

00:07:28.614 --> 00:07:30.082
if they vote to expel me or not,

00:07:30.082 --> 00:07:31.317
what I did was for their children

00:07:31.317 --> 00:07:31.951
and grandchildren.

00:07:31.951 --> 00:07:32.919
So we want their children

00:07:32.919 --> 00:07:33.486
and grandchildren

00:07:33.486 --> 00:07:35.188
to be safe from mass shootings.

00:07:35.188 --> 00:07:36.422
We want them to live lives

00:07:36.422 --> 00:07:38.124
where they can flourish and be children

00:07:38.124 --> 00:07:39.025
and not have to do active

00:07:39.025 --> 00:07:40.293
shooter drills or live in schools

00:07:40.293 --> 00:07:41.694
that look like militarized zones.

00:07:41.694 --> 00:07:42.328
And so we'll continue

00:07:42.328 --> 00:07:43.396
to lift up the issue

00:07:43.396 --> 00:07:43.863
and we'll continue

00:07:43.863 --> 00:07:45.164
to speak truth to power.

00:07:45.164 --> 00:07:46.766
And I'll be back at the Capitol

00:07:46.766 --> 00:07:47.767
on Monday on the outside

00:07:47.767 --> 00:07:49.902
with those protesting, demanding action

00:07:49.902 --> 00:07:51.537
from my former colleagues.

00:07:51.537 --> 00:07:52.839
Justin Jones,

00:07:52.839 --> 00:07:54.340
we appreciate you joining us.

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:55.708
Our regards best to you

00:07:55.708 --> 00:07:57.510
to the best of everything, to you

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:58.945
and your colleagues. Thank you so much.

00:08:00.513 --> 00:08:00.880
Thank you.

